member.summary:
Marker interface that indicates a type provides a static method that populates  metadata for the
returned value from a given  route handler delegate. The method must be of the form:
public static void PopulateMetadata( method,  metadata,  services)

Marker interface that indicates a type provides a static method that populates  metadata for a
parameter on a route handler delegate. The method must be of the form:
public static void PopulateMetadata( parameter,  builder)
